# Academic documents. A degree audit is an education record containing a
# student ID and a full grade history, and this application has no auth,
# no encryption at rest, and no retention policy. Real audits never get
# committed — run tools/redact_audit.py and commit the redacted text
# fixture instead.
*.pdf
!backend/audit_import/unt/tests/fixtures/*.pdf